Package: mbiedesign
Title: Model-based cancer screening trial design
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Kemal Caglar", "Gogebakan", , "kmlcglr@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Model-based design of cancer screening trials that use late-stage
    cancer incidence as the endpoint. A calibrated multistate natural-history
    model, fit by maximum likelihood to population incidence data, is used to
    project stage-specific trial outcomes under the traditional and
    intended-effect (IE) designs, and to compute the per-arm sample size and
    relative efficiency of each design.
